<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 195-5 AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 195-5 AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal were 195 for five against Natal at tea on the final day of the Supersport Series match at the Wanderers.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 407 and 241-8 declared</p>
<p>Transvaal 241 and 195-5 (Daryll Cullinan 73 not out)</p>
